blocks.en:
Prompt C.7: Translate-then-Evaluate Prompt [System] You are an evaluator of machine translation quality. Rubric Adequacy, Fluency, Terminology — full criteria. Complete the evaluation in two steps: 1. Mentally translate the Swahili output into English and
state your English understanding. 2. Evaluate the output based on this English understanding,
applying all rubric criteria. Show both steps before reporting the final score. [User] Evaluate the quality of the following machine translation. Source text (English) {SOURCE TEXT} Reference translation (Swahili) {REFERENCE TRANSLATION} Model translation (Swahili) {TEXT TO EVALUATE}

